# The image is built from the repository's root (apps/api/Dockerfile).
#
# Everything is left out, and then what the image is made of is let back in —
# so no .env, no .storage and no customer's file can be in a build's context,
# whatever a laptop happens to hold.
*
!package.json
!apps/api/pyproject.toml
!apps/api/uv.lock
!apps/api/src
**/__pycache__
